{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "PISCIS x MACHINA 4.44 You [are] Fish",
    "steam_appid": 3219440,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YEAH</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OKAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero needs the coherence cores. You're just a silly little dump fish NPC who has been given the opportunity of a lifetime to play a supporting role in the epic of PISCIS x MACHINA: 4.44 you (are) fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They even dedicated the subtitle to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you (you) are fish! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>General Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piscis x Machina is a third person fishing adventure game. Play as a sidekick npc fish and hookshot your way across the island to stop the moon from crashing into the island. Talk and trade with the villagers of the trash island to find COHERENCE CORES, the only fuel strong enough to save the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detailed Features and Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To cast with the fishing rod, point your cursor/rod at a target, click to cast, and if your rod has enough range, the hook will attach to the target.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To catch a fish, hook the fish with the cast mechanic, and rotate the mouse in a circle to reel the fish towards you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk up to characters on the island and press the interact button to talk to them. Each character wants a specific item you. It\u2019s upon you to find the item on the island and give it to them in order to trade up to the next item in the quest. Everybody wants something!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather collectables for trading using the same hook and reel mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To grapple using the fishing rod, use the target and hook mechanics just like fishing and use the reel to pull yourself to the grapple point!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with characters to upgrade your fishing rod. Each upgrade will extend the rod\u2019s range and will help you reach places that are harder to get to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will automatically pick up a coherence core when you touch it. The power of the coherence core is so strong that it will scramble your atoms while carrying it. Don\u2019t worry though! It\u2019s perfectly safe and you won\u2019t suffer any damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You win the game by collecting all five coherence cores and delivering them to the hero of the story.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>General Overview of Mature Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the non-playable characters\u2019 dialog contain profane language.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no sexual content except maybe the moon has an exposed butt if you consider that sexual. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not have any explicit references to drugs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piscis x Machina is a non-violent game with no depictions of violence to human or humanoid characters. However, there is the threat of imminent doom but you can prevent all of that by winning the game!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YEAH</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OKAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero needs the coherence cores. You're just a silly little dump fish NPC who has been given the opportunity of a lifetime to play a supporting role in the epic of PISCIS x MACHINA: 4.44 you (are) fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They even dedicated the subtitle to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's you,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you (you) are fish! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>General Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piscis x Machina is a third person fishing adventure game. Play as a sidekick npc fish and hookshot your way across the island to stop the moon from crashing into the island. Talk and trade with the villagers of the trash island to find COHERENCE CORES, the only fuel strong enough to save the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detailed Features and Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To cast with the fishing rod, point your cursor/rod at a target, click to cast, and if your rod has enough range, the hook will attach to the target.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To catch a fish, hook the fish with the cast mechanic, and rotate the mouse in a circle to reel the fish towards you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk up to characters on the island and press the interact button to talk to them. Each character wants a specific item you. It\u2019s upon you to find the item on the island and give it to them in order to trade up to the next item in the quest. Everybody wants something!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather collectables for trading using the same hook and reel mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To grapple using the fishing rod, use the target and hook mechanics just like fishing and use the reel to pull yourself to the grapple point!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with characters to upgrade your fishing rod. Each upgrade will extend the rod\u2019s range and will help you reach places that are harder to get to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will automatically pick up a coherence core when you touch it. The power of the coherence core is so strong that it will scramble your atoms while carrying it. Don\u2019t worry though! It\u2019s perfectly safe and you won\u2019t suffer any damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You win the game by collecting all five coherence cores and delivering them to the hero of the story.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>General Overview of Mature Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the non-playable characters\u2019 dialog contain profane language.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no sexual content except maybe the moon has an exposed butt if you consider that sexual. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not have any explicit references to drugs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piscis x Machina is a non-violent game with no depictions of violence to human or humanoid characters. However, there is the threat of imminent doom but you can prevent all of that by winning the game!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The most unhinged fishing game you've ever seen! Fish and hookshot your way around trash island to collect the coherence cores to win! Fish you! You (are) fish!",
